import{_ as i,o as t,c as o,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 572 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Fusion","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 572 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Fusion","no":572,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Dao-Integration Realm","Law Fusion","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0572_模块3-加速域-合道境适配.md","filePath":"en/0572_模块3-加速域-合道境适配.md"}'),n={name:"en/0572_模块3-加速域-合道境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-572-acceleration-domain-dao-integration-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-fusion" tabindex="-1">Entry 572 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-572-acceleration-domain-dao-integration-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 572 | Acceleration Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Fusion&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 21; Benchmark library: Entry 571</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-one-dao-to-multiple-daos-fused" tabindex="-1">Introduction: from &quot;one Dao&quot; to &quot;multiple Daos fused&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-one-dao-to-multiple-daos-fused" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: from &quot;one Dao&quot; to &quot;multiple Daos fused&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Origin lets the cultivator establish his own Dao-Principle; Dao-Integration requires him to <strong>fuse</strong> this Dao-Principle with other laws, other Dao-Principles (Document 14). Dao-Integration is the sage-cultivation four realms&#39; first realm, meaning the cultivator henceforth enters &quot;sage&quot; ranks. Fusion is not simple superposition, but requires originally independent law clauses to form a self-consistent whole in his consciousness — how do Fire Law and Water Law coexist? How do Time Law and Causality Law mutually verify? These questions must be answered in Dao-Integration.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in Dao-Integration enter the sage stage&#39;s first major exam: anti-predation axiom requires fusion be &quot;symbiotic fusion,&quot; not &quot;devouring other Daos&quot;; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the cultivator&#39;s Dao-Principle fuse with Myriad-Rank Dao-Principles, not lord over; collective ascension axiom requires the fused law whole feed back to Myriad Ranks; causal self-discipline axiom requires the fusion process not perturb real causality; law-first axiom takes &quot;Dao-Integration adapted flow&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-law-fusion-especially-suits-acceleration" tabindex="-1">I. Why Law Fusion Especially Suits Acceleration <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-law-fusion-especially-suits-acceleration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Law Fusion Especially Suits Acceleration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Integration&#39;s core task is &quot;doing large-scale logical integration in consciousness.&quot; This is similar to Law-Origin&#39;s &quot;reading,&quot; both information-processing tasks, but larger scale: Law-Origin reads single laws; Dao-Integration pieces dozens of laws into a self-consistent system. This task naturally suits high-multiple acceleration:</p><ul><li>Logical relations between laws are stable, do not change with time-flow rate;</li><li>Consciousness in accelerated state may process more fusion branches in parallel;</li><li>&quot;Logical conflicts&quot; during fusion may be quickly trial-and-errored in the acceleration domain.</li></ul><p>Thus Dao-Integration is the sage-cultivation four realms&#39; <strong>best suited to high-multiple acceleration</strong> realm. The Origin Acceleration Domain opens 100× to 500× flow for Dao-Integration.</p><h2 id="ii-dao-integration-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Dao-Integration Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-dao-integration-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Dao-Integration Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>100–500×</td><td>Highest gear among sage-cultivation four realms</td></tr><tr><td>Fusion-Branch Count</td><td>Explore 3–11 fusion paths simultaneously</td><td>More than 11 splits consciousness</td></tr><tr><td>Conflict Arbitration</td><td>Alaya Network real-time arbitration</td><td>Prevent fusion logic from self-contradiction</td></tr><tr><td>Fusion Cooldown</td><td>Per 500 consecutive acceleration hours, 24-hour cooldown</td><td>Prevent consciousness overheating</td></tr><tr><td>Fusion Output Return</td><td>Full return after fusion system complete</td><td>For Myriad-Rank reuse</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s key is &quot;multi-branch parallel, network arbitration, full return.&quot; Multi-branch parallel lets the cultivator in the acceleration domain use a few months to try fusion paths that in reality would take centuries; network arbitration ensures he does not self-contradict during fusion; full return makes his fusion system immediately Myriad Ranks&#39; public asset.</p><h2 id="iii-myriad-rank-reuse-of-fusion-systems" tabindex="-1">III. Myriad-Rank Reuse of Fusion Systems <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-myriad-rank-reuse-of-fusion-systems" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Myriad-Rank Reuse of Fusion Systems&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A Dao-Integration cultivator&#39;s completed fusion system is not his private property. The Alaya Network disassembles it into &quot;fusion modules,&quot; opens to Myriad Ranks:</p><ul><li>Other Dao-Integration cultivators may directly call verified fusion modules, not start from zero;</li><li>Technique masters develop new technique systems based on these modules;</li><li>Fusion-failed cases also enter the library, as &quot;civilizational correction&quot; material.</li></ul><p>This mechanism turns Dao-Integration from &quot;personal enlightenment&quot; into a &quot;Myriad-Rank co-built fusion library.&quot; In the old predatory-faction system, Dao-Integration is the strong one&#39;s private result of centuries in closed-door cultivation; outsiders cannot even glance; in Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, fusion modules are public goods from day one.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-devouring-other-daos" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Devouring Other Daos&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-devouring-other-daos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Devouring Other Daos&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, Dao-Integration&#39;s shortcut is &quot;devouring others&#39; Dao-Principles&quot;: seizing others&#39; established Dao-Principles, forcibly merging into own consciousness. This approach&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>Forcibly merged Dao-Principles incompatible with own, long-term internal conflict;</li><li>The devoured one&#39;s Dao-Principle residues will pollute the fusion system, must rupture later;</li><li>It trains &quot;robbers,&quot; not &quot;fusors.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Dao-Integration acceleration gear does zero-tolerance detection of &quot;foreign Dao-Principle residue&quot;: once found, immediately freeze acceleration permission, force entry into Quest Sediment Domain to walk the complete fusion process. This rule makes &quot;Dao-devouring&quot;彻底 lose on the time ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: put the highest-multiple acceleration on Dao-Integration, best suited to information integration, avoiding invalid idling in consciousness</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: fusion all self-built; foreign Dao-Principle residue zero-tolerance; from time permission seals the Dao-devouring shortcut</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Dao-Integration relies on protagonist&#39;s talent self-enlightenment; fusion is private; Heng Yuan&#39;s fusion modules open to 99% of Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages&#39; fusion modules each build libraries; consciousness-information race&#39;s &quot;logical fusion,&quot; energy-condensation race&#39;s &quot;resonance fusion&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: fusion algorithm, module library, arbitration rules all public; this is the sage segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-version-iteration-of-fusion-modules" tabindex="-1">VI. Version Iteration of Fusion Modules <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-version-iteration-of-fusion-modules" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Version Iteration of Fusion Modules&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Fusion modules output by Dao-Integration are not final versions, but living documents under continuous iteration. The Alaya Network maintains version numbers for each fusion module: a cultivator finding a module malfunctioning in Quest-Domain life submits an issue; the acceleration domain releases a new version based on the issue; the new version after simulated verification replaces the old. This version iteration keeps fusion systems forever synchronized with Myriad Ranks&#39; real use. In the predatory-faction system, a fusion system once self-enlightened by the strong is closed-garaged, not updated for centuries; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s fusion modules iterate openly like open-source software, sturdier the more used.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Integration is the key realm from &quot;one Dao&quot; to &quot;ten thousand methods returning to origin.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain here gives the sage stage&#39;s highest-multiple flow, because law fusion the faster the better, the more people try the better. But acceleration&#39;s precondition is &quot;hand it over as soon as fused&quot; — this is precisely Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s most fundamental attitude toward knowledge continued at the sage stage.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./571_模块3-加速域-道元境适配.html">571-Acceleration-Domain Dao-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const f=i(n,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,f as default};
